      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We installed an 11.8 Kw solar system with a 32KwH battery through JC Energy and are extremely happy with everything.  We received three quotes and we found their quote suited us best.  I believe their panel layout and design was the best option for our house and they also recommended the best sized battery.  One other company recommended a much bigger battery that we would rarely fill in winter and the other company recommended a smaller battery that would mean we would be having multiple charge and discharge cycles per day, thus shorten the battery life .  I can confirm that the amount of energy produced by the panels and amount that we have been able to export back to the grid has been slightly more than JC Energy estimated in their detailed quote.  While this is only based on the first two weeks of use, we have had a number of extremely cloudy days during this period.  So unlike one of the other companies that provided a quote, they don't appear to have over promised and under delivered on the performance of the system.As for the installation team they were a great group and the whole installation was extremely neat and tidy.Overall the whole team from Mikayla in the office who I spoke to several times, Jay who came out , designed the system and provided the quote, through to Josh and the installation team, we are very pleased with their work and the system they recommended.Regarding price -  they were substantially cheaper than one of the other companies that quoted for the work, and extremely similar to the third company.In summary we found that JC Energy provided a very friendly and  professional service;  an accurate estimate of what we can expect from the system; good quality panels, inverter, gateway  and batteries; a very neat and tidy install; and good after sales service, all for a fair price.   I would certainly recommend them.",
