      "review_description": "I wanted to upgrade from our very old solar system and inverter and replace it with a larger array and also include a battery to take advantage of the current battery rebate. First contact with the company was with Jay who visited my home to provide a quote. Jay knows his stuff and listens to your expectations, no hard sell, he provided me with a quote that I found reasonable and within my budget. Not long after I received a phone call that my system would be installed the following week. The installers arrived on time, what a great bunch of blokes, friendly and really hard workers. After the work was finished they cleaned up the area and removed all the packaging material and the old solar system. Josh explained the system and the app, it was just an easy process, everything from the rebates to grid connection was all taken care of by them. I am more than happy with JC Energy and the great Sigenergy system install, it is working fantastically. Highly recommend this company.",
