      "review_description": "The recent battery rebate lead me to source installing a battery to compliment my solar already installed.  I was directed to Dylan from JC Energy.  Dylan was prompt to attend and assess my situation and make a recommendation based on that.  He was very informative and friendly to deal with and explained costs re: bills etc.  I accepted the professional proposal they presented and before long was booked in for a 6 battery install.  At the moment there was a high demand due to the rebate but JC Energy assured me all would go ahead and they did.  Josh and his crew attended and worked around us as to when the power was off for short periods.  Josh was very friendly accomodating and did a great job with the install and finished about lunch time.  When dealing with payment and bookings Mikayala was extremely helpful and also great to deal with. The unit is neat and out of the way and all things operational was explained.I would highly recommend JC Energy from start to finish if you are thinking of installing solar.RegardsChris B",
