      "review_description": "We contacted these guys as part of our renovation process. All the other companies would only do a Google maps quote, but we needed a face to face quote due to the complexity of our project.Nothing short of outstanding customer service, attention to detail and when the day arrived for installation there was not one rude word, all of the team were happy and polite. Dylan and his team left the property clean and tidy, even though it is a total construction ? site still.We have already recommended Dylan to two of our mates because the work done was of such a professional standard.We want to personally thank Dylan and the team ( including the wonderful office staff) for making the whole process feel simple and efficient!We just can’t say enough good things about this team!",
